  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "永續發展與文化創新講座",
    "sub_ename": "FORUM FOR SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT AND  CULTURAL INNOVATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要是提供學生可以透過國內外專家來增進其對永續發展的世界趨勢與具體作法來理解其背後的文化之關聯性有所理解之外，並且經由各國或台灣政府與各種組織在永續發展上所採行策略的探討，使學生能發現文化創新對於永續發展所具有的重要性。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course will help students to learn the sustainable trends of world and their embodiments that are actually related to culture of Nations, through the speeches of experts around the world. Whilst, lead students to find cultural innovations are important for the sustainable development, through studying the strategies which were took by governments or NGOs, NPOs of Taiwan or other Nations.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
